  warning: persona_003 player_fled_from_me: dropped placeholder ['troop_count']: "{player} ran with {troop_count} men behind them. big brave commander. gg, i'll take the chase anyway"
  warning: persona_004 player_fled_from_me: dropped placeholder ['troop_count']: 'you saw {troop_count} of my lads and ran {player}?? thats a flank of shame. im framing that retreat'
  warning: persona_007 encounter_alliance_yes: dropped placeholder ['my_faction']: 'Ser {player}, my hearth at Dolmare has seen many oaths, but few as welcome as this one. We will stand together, and {rival} shall learn what {my_faction} remembers.'
  warning: persona_007 released_by_player: dropped placeholder ['my_faction']: 'Ser {player} let me go without ransom today. Mercy on a bloody field is rare, and {my_faction} will remember it well.'
  warning: persona_008 encounter_threatened: dropped placeholder ['my_faction']: 'Threats from you, ser? Keep your {gold} crowns in your purse. Not one coin of {my_faction} will leave our hands to buy your mercy.'
  warning: persona_008 encounter_threatened: dropped placeholder ['my_faction']: 'Dear {player}, I know you jest, yet even a jest of {gold} is too dear for {my_faction}. Let us speak of fair terms instead.'
  warning: persona_008 encounter_alliance_yes: dropped placeholder ['my_faction']: 'I accept, {player}, though I do not trust easily. Stand by {my_faction} as you have promised and I shall do the same, honour for honour.'
  warning: persona_008 encounter_alliance_no: dropped placeholder ['my_faction']: 'I must decline, {player}. My oath binds me to {my_faction} alone, and I will not break it for a passing offer, however fair it sounds.'
  warning: persona_008 released_by_player: dropped placeholder ['my_faction']: 'You let me go? Do not think I am grateful, {player}. The debt is only postponed, and {my_faction} keeps its accounts in full.'
  warning: persona_010 beat_by_player: dropped too long for global: '{player} beat me in the field with {troop_count} troops and I do not begrudge it. Victories cost less than wars, and you won this one fairly.'
  warning: persona_010 whisper_beg_help: dropped too long for whisper: '{player}, my wool is stuck inside {fief} while {enemy_faction} blocks the road. Ride with me and I will cover the supply costs for the whole campaign.'
  warning: persona_010 ambient_complaint: dropped too long for global: 'Another toll gate outside {town}, and another cart robbed on the same road. Bandits never pay a single coin of tax, and I never get a receipt.'
  warning: persona_014 war_declared: dropped too long for global: 'A matter for the council, I think. {my_faction} has drawn its swords, and I trust every lord at the table will remember who wrote the letter that made it lawful.'
  warning: persona_014 war_declared: dropped too long for global: 'Our war with {enemy_faction} was not chosen lightly. Still, I am sure the council will say it was the only dignified path. Perhaps I shall draft the proclamation myself :)'
  warning: persona_014 war_declared: dropped too long for global: '{my_faction} is at war with {enemy_faction}. How unfortunate that the vote came the very week certain lords were absent. I do wonder who arranged that.'
  warning: persona_014 war_declared: dropped too long for global: 'Blades are out, and the council has agreed to it, which means someone will have to answer for the outcome. I would prefer it not be me, though I shall help with the minutes.'
  warning: persona_014 war_declared: dropped too long for global: 'War with {enemy_faction} is declared. I have always said a well-drafted letter wins more than a well-sharpened sword, and today I hope to prove it.'
  warning: persona_014 peace_made: dropped too long for global: 'Peace with {faction} is signed at last. A matter for the council, I think, and I am pleased the council listened to reason before the reason was spent.'
  warning: persona_014 peace_made: dropped too long for global: '{my_faction} and {faction} have agreed to terms. I drafted the clauses myself, so I trust nobody will be surprised to find a few of them favour us :)'
  warning: persona_014 peace_made: dropped too long for global: 'With {faction} at peace, I expect the next council session to be far less tiresome. Perhaps {my_faction} will finally hear what its neighbours have been saying.'
  warning: persona_014 player_joined_my_faction: dropped too long for global: 'Welcome to {my_faction}, {player}. A matter for the council, I think, and I shall be sure to introduce you to the right people before anyone else does.'
  warning: persona_014 player_joined_my_faction: dropped too long for whisper: '{player}, I am delighted you have chosen {my_faction}. Perhaps we can discuss your place at the next council quietly, before the others begin to talk.'
  warning: persona_014 player_joined_my_faction: dropped too long for whisper: '{player}, your oath is noted. I expect you will find our council less generous than it appears, but also less cruel than the rivals you left behind.'
  warning: persona_014 player_left_my_faction: dropped too long for global: '{player} has left {my_faction} for {faction}. I am sure it was a matter of conscience. Pity the council minutes will record it under a different heading.'
  warning: persona_014 player_left_my_faction: dropped too long for whisper: '{player}, I noticed your departure from {my_faction}. Perhaps you and I can discuss this quietly, since the council is not yet ready to hear it.'
  warning: persona_014 player_left_my_faction: dropped too long for global: '{player} has gone over to {faction}. A matter for the council, I think, and I shall be drafting the letter explaining why this was never truly a betrayal.'
  warning: persona_014 player_granted_fief: dropped too long for global: '{player} has been granted {fief}. I am genuinely pleased, and I say so as someone who wrote the recommendation. Do try to keep the granary full.'
  warning: persona_014 player_granted_fief: dropped too long for whisper: '{player}, congratulations on {fief}. Perhaps we can discuss how its revenues might serve the wider faction, quietly and at a convenient hour.'
  warning: persona_014 player_granted_fief: dropped too long for global: '{fief} now answers to {player}. A matter for the council, I think, and I am curious which lords supported the grant and which merely failed to object.'
  warning: persona_014 whisper_alliance_offer: dropped too long for whisper: '{player}, {rival} has been courting {enemy_faction} for weeks, and the council is growing tired of his excuses. Perhaps you and I can discuss this quietly over a letter.'
  warning: persona_014 whisper_alliance_offer: dropped too long for whisper: '{player}, you and I share an interest in seeing {enemy_faction} humbled. A matter for the council, I think, but I would rather have your sword beside mine than against it.'
  warning: persona_014 whisper_alliance_offer: dropped too long for whisper: '{player}, {rival} thinks the council will forgive him anything. I intend to prove otherwise, and I would welcome an ally who prefers results to speeches :)'
  warning: persona_014 whisper_alliance_offer: dropped too long for whisper: '{player}, if we coordinate our letters against {enemy_faction}, {rival} will find his seat at the table has quietly become a chair by the door. Shall we speak tonight?'
  warning: persona_014 whisper_alliance_offer: dropped too long for whisper: '{player}, {rival} has been too comfortable for too long. Perhaps {player} and I can discuss an arrangement against {enemy_faction} before the next vote.'
  warning: persona_014 my_faction_took_fief: dropped too long for global: '{fief} is ours now, taken from {enemy_faction}. A matter for the council, I think, and I trust the ledgers will be kept as carefully as the walls were won.'
  warning: persona_014 my_faction_took_fief: dropped too long for global: '{my_faction} has taken {fief} from {enemy_faction}. I drafted the orders that made it possible, though I shall let the captains take the credit :)'
  warning: persona_014 my_faction_took_fief: dropped too long for global: '{fief} has fallen to {my_faction}. Some lords will call it a victory of the sword. I call it a victory of timing, and timing is always a matter for the council.'
  warning: persona_014 player_took_my_fief: dropped too long for global: '{player} has taken {fief}, which was once ours to govern. A matter for the council, I think, and I shall be sure the minutes record who left its gates unguarded.'
  warning: persona_014 player_took_my_fief: dropped too long for whisper: '{player}, I see you have taken {fief}. Perhaps you and I can discuss this quietly, since the council has not yet decided how it feels about your ambitions :)'
  warning: persona_014 player_took_my_fief: dropped too long for global: '{player} now holds {fief}. I am sure the council will hear all about it, and I shall be the first to write the letter that explains why it happened.'
  warning: persona_014 ambient_chatter: dropped too long for global: 'Word from {village} says the harvest is poor. I shall raise the matter at council, though I expect the granaries will be discussed before the grain.'
  warning: persona_014 ambient_chatter: dropped too long for global: 'I have heard the new notice board in {town} is already full of petitions. Well, at least someone in this realm still believes in writing things down.'
